    "# Used to automatically extract interactions from each cage.\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "# NOTE:\n",
    "# The spreadsheet is organized horizontally by cage.\n",
    "# Each cage occupies two columns:\n",
    "#     Winners | Losers\n",
    "#\n",
    "# These dictionaries allow the analysis to automatically\n",
    "# loop through all cages without hard-coding each cage\n",
    "# separately.\n",
